# Only pyproject.toml, uv.lock and ingestion/ belong in the image. Manuals (incl. the internal one), embeddings,
# eval results and local credentials must never be uploaded to Cloud Build or baked into the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!ingestion/
ingestion/__pycache__/
!api/
api/__pycache__/
# the agent's prompt, only (sg-api's leak check compares answers with it); never agent/storegear/.env
!agent/
agent/*
!agent/storegear/
agent/storegear/*
!agent/storegear/prompts/
agent/storegear/prompts/*
!agent/storegear/prompts/system_es.md
